@startuml
title Shared review app lifecycle

participant "Prism process\n(MCP server or prism review)" as Client
database "Discovery file,\nproject list, and lock" as Discovery
participant "Review app" as App
actor "Browser tab" as Tab

== Discovery ==
Client -> Discovery : read port, control credential, protocol version
alt discovery names a healthy app with the same or newer protocol
  Client -> App : health check (control credential)
  App --> Client : healthy
else no healthy app
  Client -> App ** : start detached app
  App -> Discovery : take lock, keep previous port and viewer credential if free
  App -> Discovery : write discovery file, reload registered projects
  Client -> Discovery : wait a bounded time for a healthy app
else app protocol is older
  Client -> App : handoff shutdown (control credential)
  App -> Discovery : keep discovery file, release lock
  destroy App
  Client -> App ** : start detached app on the same port
  App -> Tab : reconnected tab accepts the new instance's session
end

== Registration ==
Client -> App : register project lease (control credential)
loop while the session runs
  Client -> App : renew lease naming the project
  App -> Discovery : renew lock, stop serving if the lock was taken
end

== Presentation ==
Client -> App : present tabs for project B (control credential)
alt no tab is connected and no open lease is held
  App --> Client : open a browser
  Client -> Tab ** : open the browser on project B in its own environment
else a tab is connected
  App --> Client : no browser needed
end

== Fallback ==
note over Client
  Condition: the app cannot be started, reached, or trusted.
  Response: serve this project from a server inside this process for the rest of the session.
  Governing requirement: single-review-app.md section 6.
end note

== Exit ==
note over App
  Condition: no live lease and no viewer for the idle period.
  Response: remove the discovery file, release the lock, and exit.
end note
@enduml
